<title>JAPAN: Shin Nippon Machine - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin Nippon Machine - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.77		vs	    7.50</p>
<p> Operating	prft 211 million	  vs   loss 227    million</p>
<p> Current	    196    million	  vs	   84    million</p>
<p> Net		   84    million	  vs	   69    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.86 yen	  vs	    3.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin Nippon Machinery Co Ltd enjoys an overwhelming market share in medium and small-sized turbines and process pumps.</p>
